      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，决定暂时降低脚的操劳，\n一边在相对缓和的比赛熟悉身体状况，\n一边努力“累积粉丝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3924a81711d157ee35d54b3f11074ca3c09276e430e637418d2286a27a2a76aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
