      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风的脚顺利地成长，\n名气也顺利提升。\n终于要开始认真参加比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3109e8d45f11ede6d4b368ac7827ad37ce36372492fb8aecd940cf7acbda7b50",
