      "uid": "zhcn:ab0c1769692efab95ea99d86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示自己将在比赛中极力展现自己的坏，\n要让世人对她的恐惧持续一百年。\n换句话说就是想要名留青史的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f413f3499e3ae2ae5da26c388c0ecc93c42ba79c95097b3afa48997d2c7b6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
