      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先先要累积优胜战绩。\n将下一个目标定为和出道战条件接近的\n重赏比赛“独角兽锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf2cbb187cf74d622388557588975f26b6d0abcc5d72a7d2affe1d31e7aad31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
